note joinpg: forge/tests helper. Leave the process group forge put this process in by joining
note the parent's (forge's) own group, then sleep 20 s. Exit 2 if the join fails, so a test that
note expects a timeout cannot pass without the join.
fn main to int
p = getppid
g = getpgid int p
r = setpgid 0 int g
if lt r 0
exit 2
end
x = sleepns 20000000000
ret 0
end
